# TSAN suppressions (tools/build.sh passes this file in TSAN_OPTIONS; docs/testing.md, "Sanitizers").
# Only third-party code may be listed: Mesa (llvmpipe, lavapipe), X11, fontconfig and the vendored
# libraries under libs/ and engine/libs/. Engine and editor code is never suppressed: fix it.
# Every entry has a comment line above it giving the reason.
# stb_image's failure reason is one global in this build: decoders on several threads write it (a
# failed format probe does on every decode), and a wrong message of a failed decode is all it can do
race:stbi__err
